sequenceDiagram
    participant CM as ConfigMap<br/>/meta/job.json
    participant Job as K8s Job Pod<br/>GarakAdapter
    participant Auth as Auth Resolver<br/>Secrets/Env
    participant Garak as Garak CLI<br/>Subprocess
    participant LLM as Target LLM<br/>Endpoint
    participant KFP as Kubeflow Pipelines<br/>API Server
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible<br/>Storage
    participant OCI as OCI Registry
    participant EH as Eval-Hub<br/>Service

    Note over Job: Job starts

    Job->>CM: Read JobSpec
    CM-->>Job: Benchmark config,<br/>model endpoint, scan profile

    Job->>Auth: Resolve credentials
    Auth-->>Job: API Key<br/>(multi-tier chain)

    alt Simple Mode
        Job->>Garak: Build & execute CLI command
        Note over Garak: Runs as subprocess<br/>in Job pod
        Garak->>LLM: Red-teaming probes<br/>(HTTPS, API Key auth)
        LLM-->>Garak: LLM responses
        Garak-->>Job: JSONL report output
        Job->>Job: Parse JSONL results
    else KFP Mode
        Job->>KFP: Submit 6-step pipeline<br/>(KFP_AUTH_TOKEN)
        Note over KFP: 1. Validation<br/>2. Taxonomy Resolution<br/>3. SDG Generation<br/>4. Prompt Preparation<br/>5. Garak Scan<br/>6. Result Publishing
        KFP->>S3: Store/retrieve artifacts<br/>(AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY)
        S3-->>KFP: Artifacts
        KFP->>LLM: Execute Garak scan<br/>(OPENAICOMPATIBLE_API_KEY)
        LLM-->>KFP: LLM responses
        Job->>KFP: Poll for completion
        KFP-->>Job: Pipeline results
        Job->>S3: Download results<br/>(AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY)
        S3-->>Job: Scan artifacts
    end

    Job->>OCI: Persist result artifacts
    Job->>EH: Report results via<br/>DefaultCallbacks

    Note over Job: Job exits
